6. **M's ruling on 28b-07 is (b): the block's lead-ins stop saying the chapters rest on it.** Main **L11808** (*these are the works Chapter 35 rests on*) and **L11854** (*§R.7's two blocks are the works the chapters rest on*) are re-worded to name what is true as printed --- the works **entered with the chapters** at registers 1701–1712 and 1713–1724 --- and assert no dependence. **Montgomery's sentence at L11821 stands as written**, which is what PROV measured. **Consequence R3 should carry deliberately:** ruling (b) leaves the six post-2015 three-body works and Madelung in the blocks, so **32a-style scope questions about them do not recur** --- the block no longer claims what they were failing to satisfy. Docket 9(b) / 17.
