9. **New, and it is the largest thing this chat found: 32a-03 moves a whole class of figure into docket 38.** `numbers-index.py`, `densities.py`, `indices.py`, `appendix_audit.py`, `mathreg.py`, `compendium.py`, `register_gen.py` and `guard.py` are **not members of this build**, and register 435 records the first two as having been **absent and rebuilt from the printed rules**. Every §2.21 build readout --- E(G), the open item count, E(Q) unfibred, the register's span, the withdrawal ratio, Appendix D's element count and §32.1.4's total --- is therefore a figure **no member of the artefact can recompute**. `build.py` is a member and computes none of them. **R3: either the readout scripts become members, or every §2.21 readout carries the docket-38 qualification that its instrument is not held.** This is not a defect in any figure; it is the honest standing of all seven. Docket 38 / 35.
